<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch economic indicators week of April 28.</title>
<headline>Dutch economic indicators week of April 28.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>GMT----date----indicator------------period---previous</p>
<p>0730  28/04    business confidence  March    3.9</p>
<p>0730  02/05    retail sales	   March    + 1.8 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
